### Unproven scenarios

- Whether z.ai exposes more than low|high|max on glm-5.3 (assumed three per the caps-v1 mapping).
- What SubagentStop stdin and the subagent transcript actually carry for tier and effort override - never observed in this read-only pass.
- Whether a fixed-schema digest preserves single-defect recall in practice (no replay run was possible read-only).
- Whether the intake schema at xelth.com/T/ has any versioning mechanism today, which affects how costly adding fields later really is.

